---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
---

<blockquote class="diginate">
	<h4>Diginate</h4>

	<p>
		I'm not sponsored by{' '}
		<a
			aria-label="Buy Custom Stickers from Diginate"
			href="https://diginate.com/"
			target="_blank"
		>
			Diginate
		</a>
		, but{' '}
		<a
			href="https://bsky.app/profile/willow.sh/post/3mhjomok3q22w"
			target="_blank"
		>
			they've been incredibly helpful
		</a>{' '}
		in my mission to give away as many stickers as possible, so I'm
		eternally grateful. I can't recommend them enough if you want custom
		stickers, posters, prints, and more 💙
	</p>

	<Image
		width={75}
		height={75}
		src="/logos/diginate.png"
		alt="The Diginate Logo"
	/>
</blockquote>

<style lang="scss">
	.diginate {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr max-content;
		grid-template-rows: repeat(2, max-content);
		gap: 0px 12px;

		border-color: #0183ff;

		img {
			grid-column: 2;
			grid-row: 1 / span 2;
			align-self: center;
		}

		h4,
		p {
			color: var(--text);
			margin: 0px;
		}
	}
</style>
